        "liquid": "{%- comment -%}\n  SORELYA — BLOC 08 : « The technology that works where regular creams stop »\n  Clone EXACT du bloc multicolumn BioChroma : image + titre + 3 paragraphes + 3 bénéfices à icônes.\n  Copy = traduction fidèle du texte BioChroma (mêmes points, mêmes arguments, rien adouci).\n  Mobile-first. Images servies SANS le suffixe _430x (sinon floues) + srcset.\n  Titre et libellés dans la police des titres du thème, comme les blocs 02 et 05.\n{%- endcomment -%}\n\n{%- assign sor_image = \"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0889/4106/8645/files/Progetto_senza_titolo_9a5b5178-cd01-41be-bf37-75c6121f3c11.jpg?v=1790297092\" -%}\n{%- assign sor_i1 = \"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0889/4106/8645/files/Progetto_senza_titolo_3605f16b-af48-44c7-9faf-e6a88fee39a4.jpg?v=1790297092\" -%}\n{%- assign sor_i2 = \"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0889/4106/8645/files/2_37b9bd62-80e9-4f9e-998a-d4aa4e2d8dff.jpg?v=1790297092\" -%}\n{%- assign sor_i3 = \"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0889/4106/8645/files/3_e74190f2-fe89-4a3b-903c-118af95983c8.jpg?v=1790297092\" -%}\n\n{%- assign sor_titre = \"La tecnología que actúa donde las cremas normales se detienen\" -%}\n\n<section class=\"sor-b08\">\n  <div class=\"sor-b08__img\">\n    <img src=\"{{ sor_image }}&width=800\"\n         srcset=\"{{ sor_image }}&width=500 500w, {{ sor_image }}&width=800 800w, {{ sor_image }}&width=1200 1200w\"\n         sizes=\"(min-width: 750px) 560px, 100vw\"\n         alt=\"Mujer aplicándose el Sérum Coreano de Péptidos de Seda Sorelya con el aplicador sin aguja\"\n         width=\"800\" height=\"720\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\">\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"sor-b08__txt\">\n    <h2 class=\"sor-b08__titre\">{{ sor_titre }}</h2>\n\n    <p>Los <strong>Péptidos de Seda</strong> crean una <strong>microrred</strong> invisible que actúa <strong>de forma específica</strong>, sujetando y tensando la piel justo donde los signos son más visibles.</p>\n    <p>El Colágeno de <strong>bajo peso molecular</strong> mejora la elasticidad y retiene la hidratación.</p>\n    <p>Actúan tanto en la superficie (efecto lifting inmediato) como en las capas cosméticas más profundas (piel más jugosa con el tiempo).</p>\n\n    <ul class=\"sor-b08__list\" role=\"list\">\n      <li>\n        <img src=\"{{ sor_i1 }}&width=96\" srcset=\"{{ sor_i1 }}&width=48 1x, {{ sor_i1 }}&width=96 2x, {{ sor_i1 }}&width=144 3x\" alt=\"\" width=\"34\" height=\"34\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\">\n        <span>Piel <strong>más lisa</strong> al instante</span>\n      </li>\n      <li>\n        <img src=\"{{ sor_i2 }}&width=96\" srcset=\"{{ sor_i2 }}&width=48 1x, {{ sor_i2 }}&width=96 2x, {{ sor_i2 }}&width=144 3x\" alt=\"\" width=\"34\" height=\"34\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\">\n        <span>Ingredientes <strong>innovadores</strong> y <strong>testados</strong></span>\n      </li>\n      <li>\n        <img src=\"{{ sor_i3 }}&width=96\" srcset=\"{{ sor_i3 }}&width=48 1x, {{ sor_i3 }}&width=96 2x, {{ sor_i3 }}&width=144 3x\" alt=\"\" width=\"34\" height=\"34\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\">\n        <span>Acción <strong>específica</strong> justo donde la necesitas</span>\n      </li>\n    </ul>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<style>\n  .sor-b08{\n    padding-top:var(--sor-espace-sections, 44px) !important;\n    --sor-ink:#2B2220;\n    --sor-texte:#3A302D;\n    --sor-rose-titre:#C99A8C;\n    padding:2px 0 6px;\n  }\n  .sor-b08__img{\n    border-radius:16px;\n    overflow:hidden;\n    background:#E9D3C8;\n  }\n  .sor-b08__img img{ display:block; width:100%; height:auto; }\n\n  .sor-b08__txt{ padding:22px 2px 0; }\n  .sor-b08__titre{\n    margin:0 0 16px;\n    font-family:var(--font-heading-family, inherit);\n    font-style:var(--font-heading-style, normal);\n    font-weight:var(--font-heading-weight, 700);\n    font-size:23px;\n    line-height:1.35;\n    letter-spacing:.01em;\n    text-transform:uppercase;\n    color:var(--sor-rose-titre);\n  }\n  .sor-b08__txt p{\n    margin:0 0 12px;\n    font-size:15.5px;\n    line-height:1.55;\n    color:var(--sor-texte);\n  }\n  .sor-b08__txt p strong{ color:var(--sor-ink); font-weight:700; }\n\n  .sor-b08__list{\n    list-style:none;\n    margin:18px 0 0;\n    padding:0;\n    display:flex;\n    flex-direction:column;\n    gap:14px;\n  }\n  .sor-b08__list li{\n    display:flex;\n    align-items:center;\n    gap:12px;\n    font-family:var(--font-heading-family, inherit);\n    font-weight:400;\n    font-size:15px;\n    line-height:1.3;\n    color:var(--sor-ink);\n  }\n  .sor-b08__list li strong{ font-weight:var(--font-heading-weight, 700); }\n  .sor-b08__list img{\n    flex:0 0 34px;\n    width:34px;\n    height:34px;\n    object-fit:contain;\n    mix-blend-mode:multiply;\n  }\n\n  @media (min-width:750px){\n    .sor-b08{\n      display:grid;\n      grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;\n      gap:40px;\n      align-items:center;\n      padding:8px 0 12px;\n    }\n    .sor-b08__txt{ padding:0; }\n    .sor-b08__titre{ font-size:27px; }\n    .sor-b08__txt p{ font-size:16px; }\n    .sor-b08__list li{ font-size:16px; }\n  }\n</style>",
