        "remove_vertical_spacing": true,
        "remove_horizontal_spacing": false,
        "liquid": "{%- comment -%}\n  SORELYA — BLOC 09 : « What to expect » — timeline Day 1 / Day 2 / Day 10 / Day 30\n  Clone EXACT du bloc BioChroma (titre rich text + section biochroma_timeline) :\n  4 cartes horizontales, image à gauche, badge du jour + 3 points cochés à droite.\n  Copy = traduction fidèle de BioChroma (mêmes promesses, rien adouci).\n  Mobile-first : 1 carte par ligne, image 44 % ; 2 cartes par ligne au-delà de 980 px.\n  Images servies SANS le suffixe _430x + srcset. Titres dans la police des titres du thème.\n{%- endcomment -%}\n\n{%- assign sor_titre     = \"Qué puedes esperar\" -%}\n{%- assign sor_soustitre = \"Los dermatólogos recomiendan un uso constante dos veces al día\" -%}\n\n{%- assign sor_img1 = \"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0889/4106/8645/files/Progetto_senza_titolo_5_9f730b80-e97f-4d1a-b1f9-fff855d6f5da.jpg?v=1790297092\" -%}\n{%- assign sor_img2 = \"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0889/4106/8645/files/Progetto_senza_titolo_4_041e7481-1b33-44e5-85fa-58cd2d5c82b6.jpg?v=1790297406\" -%}\n{%- assign sor_img3 = \"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0889/4106/8645/files/Progetto_senza_titolo_3_bfad26e0-3af1-46c3-970b-9ec225c078ce.jpg?v=1790297408\" -%}\n{%- assign sor_img4 = \"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0889/4106/8645/files/Progetto_senza_titolo_71b2a6db-5e28-41fc-b529-c160c248fc22.jpg?v=1790297411\" -%}\n\n{%- capture sor_check -%}<svg class=\"sor-b09__check\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"11\"/><path d=\"M7 12.5l3.2 3.2L17 9\"/></svg>{%- endcapture -%}\n\n<section class=\"sor-b09\">\n  <div class=\"sor-b09__head\">\n    <h2 class=\"sor-b09__titre\">{{ sor_titre }}</h2>\n    <p class=\"sor-b09__sub\">{{ sor_soustitre }}</p>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"sor-b09__grid\">\n\n    <article class=\"sor-b09__card\">\n      <div class=\"sor-b09__media\">\n        <img src=\"{{ sor_img1 }}&width=600\" srcset=\"{{ sor_img1 }}&width=300 300w, {{ sor_img1 }}&width=600 600w, {{ sor_img1 }}&width=900 900w\" sizes=\"(min-width: 980px) 240px, 44vw\" alt=\"Día 1\" width=\"600\" height=\"1075\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\">\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"sor-b09__content\">\n        <span class=\"sor-b09__badge\">DÍA 1</span>\n        <ul class=\"sor-b09__list\" role=\"list\">\n          <li>{{ sor_check }}<span>Masajea el sérum y observa cómo los hilos dorados se funden en tu piel.</span></li>\n          <li>{{ sor_check }}<span>Hazte una foto y tira tu vieja crema hidratante</span></li>\n          <li>{{ sor_check }}<span>Comienza la acción específica de los Péptidos de Seda</span></li>\n        </ul>\n      </div>\n    </article>\n\n    <article class=\"sor-b09__card\">\n      <div class=\"sor-b09__media\">\n        <img src=\"{{ sor_img2 }}&width=600\" srcset=\"{{ sor_img2 }}&width=300 300w, {{ sor_img2 }}&width=600 600w, {{ sor_img2 }}&width=900 900w\" sizes=\"(min-width: 980px) 240px, 44vw\" alt=\"Día 2\" width=\"600\" height=\"1075\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\">\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"sor-b09__content\">\n        <span class=\"sor-b09__badge\">DÍA 2</span>\n        <ul class=\"sor-b09__list\" role=\"list\">\n          <li>{{ sor_check }}<span>Al despertar, sientes la piel increíblemente suave, elástica y jugosa al tacto</span></li>\n          <li>{{ sor_check }}<span>Los péptidos de seda han trabajado toda la noche para crear una microrred que sujeta tu rostro.</span></li>\n          <li>{{ sor_check }}<span>Estás deseando continuar con tu rutina</span></li>\n        </ul>\n      </div>\n    </article>\n\n    <article class=\"sor-b09__card\">\n      <div class=\"sor-b09__media\">\n        <img src=\"{{ sor_img3 }}&width=600\" srcset=\"{{ sor_img3 }}&width=300 300w, {{ sor_img3 }}&width=600 600w, {{ sor_img3 }}&width=900 900w\" sizes=\"(min-width: 980px) 240px, 44vw\" alt=\"Día 10\" width=\"600\" height=\"1075\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\">\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"sor-b09__content\">\n        <span class=\"sor-b09__badge\">DÍA 10</span>\n        <ul class=\"sor-b09__list\" role=\"list\">\n          <li>{{ sor_check }}<span>Hazte una foto para comparar tus resultados</span></li>\n          <li>{{ sor_check }}<span>La diferencia se nota: las líneas de expresión se han suavizado</span></li>\n          <li>{{ sor_check }}<span>Tus amigas empiezan a preguntarte qué estás haciendo diferente</span></li>\n        </ul>\n      </div>\n    </article>\n\n    <article class=\"sor-b09__card\">\n      <div class=\"sor-b09__media\">\n        <img src=\"{{ sor_img4 }}&width=600\" srcset=\"{{ sor_img4 }}&width=300 300w, {{ sor_img4 }}&width=600 600w, {{ sor_img4 }}&width=900 900w\" sizes=\"(min-width: 980px) 240px, 44vw\" alt=\"Día 30\" width=\"600\" height=\"1075\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\">\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"sor-b09__content\">\n        <span class=\"sor-b09__badge\">DÍA 30</span>\n        <ul class=\"sor-b09__list\" role=\"list\">\n          <li>{{ sor_check }}<span>Tus fotos de antes y después lo dicen todo</span></li>\n          <li>{{ sor_check }}<span>Tu piel se ve visiblemente levantada, firme, más tensa y años más joven</span></li>\n          <li>{{ sor_check }}<span>Prepárate para responder a tus amigas: «¿Qué te has hecho en la cara? ¡Pareces mucho más joven!»</span></li>\n        </ul>\n      </div>\n    </article>\n\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<style>\n  .sor-b09{\n    padding-top:var(--sor-espace-sections, 44px) !important;\n    --sor-ink:#2B2220;\n    --sor-rose:#D9A79D;\n    --sor-rose-fonce:#9A5E53;\n    --sor-fond:#FBF6F3;\n    padding:2px 0 6px;\n  }\n  .sor-b09__head{ text-align:center; margin-bottom:16px; padding:0 4px; }\n  .sor-b09__titre{\n    margin:0 0 6px;\n    font-family:var(--font-heading-family, inherit);\n    font-style:var(--font-heading-style, normal);\n    font-weight:var(--font-heading-weight, 700);\n    font-size:31px;\n    line-height:1.2;\n    text-transform:uppercase;\n    letter-spacing:.01em;\n    color:var(--sor-ink);\n  }\n  .sor-b09__sub{ margin:0; font-size:15px; line-height:1.45; color:#5A4E4B; }\n\n  .sor-b09__grid{ display:grid; grid-template-columns:1fr; gap:14px; }\n\n  .sor-b09__card{\n    display:flex;\n    align-items:stretch;\n    border-radius:22px;\n    overflow:hidden;\n  }\n  .sor-b09__media{\n    flex:0 0 44%;\n    min-height:250px;\n    background:#F3ECE9;\n  }\n  .sor-b09__media img{ display:block; width:100%; height:100%; object-fit:cover; }\n  .sor-b09__content{\n    flex:1 1 auto;\n    display:flex;\n    flex-direction:column;\n    justify-content:center;\n    gap:14px;\n    padding:18px 14px 18px 16px;\n    background:var(--sor-fond);\n  }\n  .sor-b09__badge{\n    width:fit-content;\n    padding:7px 14px;\n    border-radius:999px;\n    background:var(--sor-rose);\n    color:#fff;\n    font-family:var(--font-heading-family, inherit);\n    font-weight:var(--font-heading-weight, 700);\n    font-size:12.5px;\n    letter-spacing:.05em;\n    line-height:1;\n  }\n  .sor-b09__list{\n    list-style:none;\n    margin:0;\n    padding:0;\n    display:grid;\n    gap:12px;\n  }\n  .sor-b09__list li{\n    display:flex;\n    align-items:flex-start;\n    gap:8px;\n    font-size:14.5px;\n    line-height:1.35;\n    color:#111;\n  }\n  .sor-b09__check{ flex:0 0 20px; width:20px; height:20px; margin-top:1px; }\n  .sor-b09__check circle{ fill:var(--sor-rose); }\n  .sor-b09__check path{ fill:none; stroke:#fff; stroke-width:2.4; stroke-linecap:round; stroke-linejoin:round; }\n\n  @media (max-width:360px){\n    .sor-b09__media{ flex-basis:40%; }\n    .sor-b09__list li{ font-size:13.5px; }\n  }\n  @media (min-width:750px){\n    .sor-b09__titre{ font-size:37px; }\n    .sor-b09__sub{ font-size:16px; }\n    .sor-b09__media{ min-height:300px; }\n    .sor-b09__content{ padding:22px 20px; }\n    .sor-b09__list li{ font-size:16px; }\n    .sor-b09__check{ flex-basis:22px; width:22px; height:22px; }\n  }\n  @media (min-width:980px){\n    .sor-b09__grid{ grid-template-columns:repeat(2, minmax(0,1fr)); gap:22px; }\n    .sor-b09__media{ flex-basis:40%; min-height:320px; }\n    .sor-b09__card{ border-radius:28px; }\n  }\n</style>",
