        "remove_vertical_spacing": true,
        "remove_horizontal_spacing": false,
        "liquid": "{%- comment -%}\n  SORELYA ES — BLOC 10b : bande de badges qui défile à l'infini\n  Placée entre le bloc 10 (ingrédients) et le bloc 11 (Formulado por expertos).\n  Version ES (2026-09-29) : les 4 badges US étaient des PNG avec du texte anglais. Ici, badges 100 % code\n  (icône SVG dans un cercle + libellé), même rendu, aucun visuel à produire, textes modifiables ci-dessous.\n  Défilement 100 % CSS : la série est rendue 4 fois et l'animation glisse de -50 %.\n  Pause au survol (desktop) ; animation coupée si l'utilisateur a demandé « réduire les animations ».\n{%- endcomment -%}\n\n{%- assign sor_libelles = \"Alta tolerancia cutánea|Cruelty free|Sin parabenos|Fórmula respetuosa con la piel\" | split: \"|\" -%}\n{%- comment -%} Durée d'un tour complet, en secondes (plus grand = plus lent). {%- endcomment -%}\n{%- assign sor_vitesse = 22 -%}\n\n{%- capture sor_ico_1 -%}<svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 3.5c2.6 3.1 4.5 5.7 4.5 8.2a4.5 4.5 0 0 1-9 0c0-2.5 1.9-5.1 4.5-8.2z\"/><path d=\"M10 13.5a2.1 2.1 0 0 0 2 1.7\"/></svg>{%- endcapture -%}\n{%- capture sor_ico_2 -%}<svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M9.5 10.5c-.8-2.8-.9-5.4.4-5.6 1.3-.2 1.9 2.6 2.1 5.3\"/><path d=\"M14.5 10.5c.8-2.8.9-5.4-.4-5.6-1.3-.2-1.9 2.6-2.1 5.3\"/><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"14.5\" r=\"4\"/><circle cx=\"10.7\" cy=\"14\" r=\".45\"/><circle cx=\"13.3\" cy=\"14\" r=\".45\"/><path d=\"M4.5 4.5l15 15\"/></svg>{%- endcapture -%}\n{%- capture sor_ico_3 -%}<svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M10 4h4\"/><path d=\"M10.5 4v5.2L6.8 16.6A2 2 0 0 0 8.6 19.5h6.8a2 2 0 0 0 1.8-2.9l-3.7-7.4V4\"/><path d=\"M8.2 14h7.6\"/><path d=\"M4.5 4.5l15 15\"/></svg>{%- endcapture -%}\n{%- capture sor_ico_4 -%}<svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 19.5V11\"/><path d=\"M12 13c-4.5 0-6.5-2.7-6.5-7 4.3 0 6.5 2.2 6.5 7z\"/><path d=\"M12 11.5c0-3.8 2.2-6 6.5-6 0 4.3-2 6-6.5 6z\"/></svg>{%- endcapture -%}\n{%- assign sor_icones = sor_ico_1 | append: \"§\" | append: sor_ico_2 | append: \"§\" | append: sor_ico_3 | append: \"§\" | append: sor_ico_4 | split: \"§\" -%}\n\n<div class=\"sor-b10b\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"Garantías de la fórmula\">\n  <div class=\"sor-b10b__track\" style=\"--sor-duree: {{ sor_vitesse }}s;\">\n    {%- for tour in (1..4) -%}\n      <ul class=\"sor-b10b__set\" role=\"list\"{% if tour > 1 %} aria-hidden=\"true\"{% endif %}>\n        {%- for lib in sor_libelles -%}\n          <li class=\"sor-b10b__item\">\n            <span class=\"sor-b10b__ico\">{{ sor_icones[forloop.index0] }}</span>\n            <span class=\"sor-b10b__lib\">{{ lib }}</span>\n          </li>\n        {%- endfor -%}\n      </ul>\n    {%- endfor -%}\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<style>\n  .sor-b10b{\n    padding-top:var(--sor-espace-sections, 44px) !important;\n    --sor-ink:#2B2220;\n    overflow:hidden;\n    width:100%;\n    padding:8px 0;\n    -webkit-mask-image:linear-gradient(90deg, transparent 0, #000 6%, #000 94%, transparent 100%);\n            mask-image:linear-gradient(90deg, transparent 0, #000 6%, #000 94%, transparent 100%);\n  }\n  .sor-b10b__track{\n    display:flex;\n    width:max-content;\n    animation:sor-b10b-defile var(--sor-duree, 22s) linear infinite;\n    will-change:transform;\n  }\n  .sor-b10b:hover .sor-b10b__track{ animation-play-state:paused; }\n  .sor-b10b__set{\n    display:flex;\n    align-items:center;\n    gap:26px;\n    margin:0;\n    padding:0 13px;\n    list-style:none;\n  }\n  .sor-b10b__item{\n    flex:0 0 auto;\n    display:flex;\n    align-items:center;\n    gap:9px;\n    white-space:nowrap;\n  }\n  .sor-b10b__ico{\n    flex:0 0 38px;\n    width:38px; height:38px;\n    border:1.6px solid var(--sor-ink);\n    border-radius:50%;\n    display:grid;\n    place-items:center;\n  }\n  .sor-b10b__ico svg{\n    width:21px; height:21px;\n    fill:none;\n    stroke:var(--sor-ink);\n    stroke-width:1.5;\n    stroke-linecap:round;\n    stroke-linejoin:round;\n  }\n  .sor-b10b__lib{\n    font-size:15px;\n    font-weight:500;\n    letter-spacing:.01em;\n    color:var(--sor-ink);\n  }\n  @keyframes sor-b10b-defile{\n    from{ transform:translateX(0); }\n    to{ transform:translateX(-50%); }\n  }\n  @media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){\n    .sor-b10b__track{ animation:none; }\n  }\n  @media (min-width:750px){\n    .sor-b10b__set{ gap:40px; padding:0 20px; }\n    .sor-b10b__ico{ width:44px; height:44px; flex-basis:44px; }\n    .sor-b10b__ico svg{ width:24px; height:24px; }\n    .sor-b10b__lib{ font-size:17px; }\n  }\n</style>",
