        "remove_vertical_spacing": true,
        "remove_horizontal_spacing": false,
        "liquid": "{%- comment -%}\n  SORELYA — BLOC 11\n  Formulado por expertos / Aprobado por dermatólogos\n{%- endcomment -%}\n\n{%- assign sor_image = \"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0992/0384/2370/files/9b608977-2673-46be-a871-d3c42173330e_430x.png?v=1790653259\" -%}\n\n{%- assign sor_alt = \"Expertas en dermatología y cuidado de la piel Sorelya\" -%}\n\n\n<section class=\"sor-b11\">\n\n  <div class=\"sor-b11__txt\">\n\n    <h2 class=\"sor-b11__titre\">\n\n      <span class=\"sor-b11__l1\">\n        Formulado por expertos\n      </span>\n\n      <span class=\"sor-b11__l2\">\n        Aprobado por dermatólogos\n      </span>\n\n    </h2>\n\n\n    <p class=\"sor-b11__copy\">\n\n      El sérum de péptidos de seda y colágeno de Sorelya es\n      <strong>único en su clase</strong>.\n\n      Al combinar una tecnología de penetración avanzada con\n      potentes ingredientes cosméticos, une tu\n      <strong>rutina diaria</strong>\n      y los\n      <strong>tratamientos profesionales</strong>.\n\n    </p>\n\n  </div>\n\n\n  <div class=\"sor-b11__img\">\n\n    <img\n      src=\"{{ sor_image }}\"\n      alt=\"{{ sor_alt | escape }}\"\n      width=\"700\"\n      height=\"800\"\n      loading=\"lazy\"\n      decoding=\"async\"\n    >\n\n  </div>\n\n</section>\n\n\n<style>\n\n.sor-b11 {\n\n  padding-top: var(--sor-espace-sections, 44px) !important;\n  padding-bottom: 8px;\n\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n\n  gap: 18px;\n\n}\n\n\n.sor-b11__titre {\n\n  margin: 0 0 12px;\n\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n\n  gap: 2px;\n\n  font-family: var(--font-heading-family, inherit);\n  font-style: var(--font-heading-style, normal);\n\n  font-size: 33px;\n  line-height: 1.15;\n  letter-spacing: 0;\n\n}\n\n\n.sor-b11__l1,\n.sor-b11__l2 {\n\n  width: fit-content;\n\n  background: linear-gradient(\n    90deg,\n    #D9A79D,\n    #E8C3BB\n  );\n\n  -webkit-background-clip: text;\n  background-clip: text;\n\n  -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\n  color: transparent;\n\n}\n\n\n.sor-b11__l1 {\n  font-weight: 400;\n}\n\n\n.sor-b11__l2 {\n  font-weight: var(--font-heading-weight, 700);\n}\n\n\n.sor-b11__copy {\n\n  margin: 0;\n\n  font-size: 17px;\n  line-height: 1.65;\n\n  color: #000;\n\n}\n\n\n.sor-b11__copy strong {\n  font-weight: 700;\n}\n\n\n.sor-b11__img {\n\n  display: flex;\n  justify-content: center;\n\n}\n\n\n.sor-b11__img img {\n\n  display: block;\n\n  width: 100%;\n  max-width: 380px;\n  height: auto;\n\n  border-radius: 22px;\n\n}\n\n\n@media (min-width: 1024px) {\n\n  .sor-b11 {\n\n    flex-direction: row;\n    align-items: center;\n\n    gap: 48px;\n\n    padding-bottom: 12px;\n\n  }\n\n\n  .sor-b11__txt {\n    flex: 1;\n  }\n\n\n  .sor-b11__titre {\n\n    font-size: 41px;\n\n    margin-bottom: 18px;\n\n  }\n\n\n  .sor-b11__copy {\n\n    font-size: 18px;\n    line-height: 1.7;\n\n    max-width: 560px;\n\n  }\n\n\n  .sor-b11__img {\n\n    flex: 1;\n\n    justify-content: flex-end;\n\n  }\n\n\n  .sor-b11__img img {\n    max-width: 520px;\n  }\n\n}\n\n</style>",
