    "sor_b12": {
      "type": "custom-liquid",
      "settings": {
        "full_width": true,
        "remove_vertical_spacing": true,
        "remove_horizontal_spacing": false,
        "liquid": "{%- comment -%}\n  SORELYA — BLOC 12 : « 3 simple steps for an at-home treatment »\n  Clone EXACT du bloc BioChroma (titre rich text + steps-section) : 3 lignes image à gauche,\n  numéro rose + texte à droite sur fond rose très clair. Copy = traduction fidèle de BioChroma.\n  Mobile-first. Images servies SANS le suffixe _430x + srcset. Titre dans la police des titres du thème.\n{%- endcomment -%}\n\n{%- assign sor_titre = \"3 sencillos pasos para un tratamiento en casa\" -%}\n\n{%- assign sor_img1 = \"sor-es-b12-etape1.jpg\" | asset_url -%}\n{%- assign sor_img2 = \"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0889/4106/8645/files/2_cdbc2d18-28cc-4bd8-8590-34de403b71b8.jpg?v=1790299978\" -%}\n{%- assign sor_img3 = \"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0889/4106/8645/files/3_8e1d6e52-7723-48a7-8b4b-875370fe4825.jpg?v=1790299978\" -%}\n\n<section class=\"sor-b12\">\n  <h2 class=\"sor-b12__titre\">{{ sor_titre }}</h2>\n\n  <div class=\"sor-b12__row\">\n    <div class=\"sor-b12__img\">\n      <img src=\"{{ sor_img1 }}&width=600\" srcset=\"{{ sor_img1 }}&width=300 300w, {{ sor_img1 }}&width=600 600w, {{ sor_img1 }}&width=900 900w\" sizes=\"(min-width: 768px) 550px, 50vw\" alt=\"Paso 1: carga el sérum con el aplicador cosmético\" width=\"600\" height=\"800\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\">\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"sor-b12__content\">\n      <span class=\"sor-b12__num\">1</span>\n      <p>Carga el sérum con el aplicador cosmético.<br>0,5 ml por la mañana<br>1 ml por la noche</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"sor-b12__row\">\n    <div class=\"sor-b12__img\">\n      <img src=\"{{ sor_img2 }}&width=600\" srcset=\"{{ sor_img2 }}&width=300 300w, {{ sor_img2 }}&width=600 600w, {{ sor_img2 }}&width=900 900w\" sizes=\"(min-width: 768px) 550px, 50vw\" alt=\"Paso 2: masajea con movimientos circulares\" width=\"600\" height=\"800\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\">\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"sor-b12__content\">\n      <span class=\"sor-b12__num\">2</span>\n      <p>Masajea con movimientos circulares.<br>Los péptidos de seda se funden con la piel y crean la microrred cosmética</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"sor-b12__row\">\n    <div class=\"sor-b12__img\">\n      <img src=\"{{ sor_img3 }}&width=600\" srcset=\"{{ sor_img3 }}&width=300 300w, {{ sor_img3 }}&width=600 600w, {{ sor_img3 }}&width=900 900w\" sizes=\"(min-width: 768px) 550px, 50vw\" alt=\"Paso 3: disfruta de los resultados\" width=\"600\" height=\"800\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\">\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"sor-b12__content\">\n      <span class=\"sor-b12__num\">3</span>\n      <p><strong>Disfruta de los resultados</strong><br>Con un uso regular, la piel se ve más firme, más elástica y más uniforme con el tiempo.</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<style>\n  .sor-b12{\n    padding-top:var(--sor-espace-sections, 44px) !important;\n    display:flex;\n    flex-direction:column;\n    gap:14px;\n    padding:7px 0 6px;\n  }\n  .sor-b12__titre{\n    margin:0 0 4px;\n    text-align:center;\n    font-family:var(--font-heading-family, inherit);\n    font-style:var(--font-heading-style, normal);\n    font-weight:var(--font-heading-weight, 700);\n    font-size:29px;\n    line-height:1.25;\n    color:#2B2220;\n  }\n  .sor-b12__row{\n    display:flex;\n    align-items:stretch;\n    border-radius:12px;\n    overflow:hidden;\n  }\n  .sor-b12__img{ flex:1; min-height:170px; background:#EFE3E0; }\n  .sor-b12__img img{ display:block; width:100%; height:100%; object-fit:cover; }\n  .sor-b12__content{\n    flex:1;\n    display:flex;\n    align-items:flex-start;\n    gap:12px;\n    padding:18px 14px;\n    background:#F6EAE8;\n  }\n  .sor-b12__num{\n    flex:0 0 30px;\n    width:30px;\n    height:30px;\n    border-radius:50%;\n    display:grid;\n    place-items:center;\n    background:#D9A79D;\n    color:#fff;\n    font-weight:600;\n    font-size:14px;\n    line-height:1;\n  }\n  .sor-b12__content p{\n    margin:0;\n    font-size:14px;\n    line-height:1.45;\n    color:#111;\n  }\n  .sor-b12__content p strong{ font-weight:700; }\n\n  @media (min-width:768px){\n    .sor-b12{ max-width:1100px; margin:0 auto; gap:18px; }\n    .sor-b12__titre{ font-size:37px; margin-bottom:8px; }\n    .sor-b12__img{ min-height:260px; }\n    .sor-b12__content{ padding:28px 26px; gap:14px; }\n    .sor-b12__content p{ font-size:16px; }\n  }\n</style>",
