    "sor_b13": {
      "type": "custom-liquid",
      "settings": {
        "full_width": true,
        "remove_vertical_spacing": true,
        "remove_horizontal_spacing": false,
        "liquid": "{%- comment -%}\n  SORELYA ES — BLOC 13 : preguntas frecuentes (FAQ)\n  Clone de la FAQ BioChroma (mêmes 7 questions, même ordre), traduite en espagnol pour Sorelya.\n  Même rendu que les accordéons du bloc 05 (mêmes classes de style, préfixe sor-b13).\n  Retiré volontairement (règle actée pour Velnora US, reprise ici) :\n  - « Vegan » : le produit contient du collagène (Hydrolyzed Collagen, Collagen dans l'INCI).\n  - « Moins de 1 % des clientes ont demandé un remboursement » : chiffre invérifiable.\n  INCI : liste complète relevée sur la PDP BioChroma FR le 2026-09-29 (même produit, bible Velnora 0.2-4).\n  Placement : section Custom Liquid sous le bloc 12, padding haut/bas 0.\n{%- endcomment -%}\n\n{%- assign sor_marque         = \"Sorelya\" -%}\n{%- assign sor_garantie_jours = \"99\" -%}\n{%- assign sor_titre          = \"Preguntas frecuentes\" -%}\n\n<section class=\"sor-b13\" id=\"sor-faq\">\n  <h2 class=\"sor-b13__h2\">{{ sor_titre }}</h2>\n\n  <details class=\"sor-b13__acc\">\n    <summary class=\"sor-b13__sum\">\n      <span class=\"sor-b13__titre\">INCI completo</span>\n      <span class=\"sor-b13__chev\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>\n    </summary>\n    <div class=\"sor-b13__body\">\n      <p>Los ingredientes se indican según la nomenclatura INCI, el estándar europeo obligatorio para todos los cosméticos.</p>\n      <p><strong>✔ 28 péptidos bioactivos</strong>: la concentración más alta que encontrarás en un sérum no médico.</p>\n      <p class=\"sor-b13__inci\">Water, Butylene Glycol, Glycerin, Methylpropanediol, 1,2-Hexanediol, Niacinamide, Silk Water, Carbomer, Tromethamine, PPG-13-Decyltetradeceth-24, Propanediol, Hydrolyzed Collagen, Adenosine, Chondrus Crispus Powder, Agar, Hydroxyethylcellulose, Disodium EDTA, Acrylates/C10-30 Alkyl Acrylate Crosspolymer, Synthetic Fluorphlogopite, Betaine, Panthenol, Glycine Soja (Soybean) Peptide, Titanium Dioxide (CI 77891), Iron Oxides (CI 77491), Mica (CI 77019), Gellan Gum, Magnesium Ascorbyl Phosphate, Centella Asiatica Extract, Houttuynia Cordata Extract, Tin Oxide, Ethylhexylglycerin, Squalane, Benzyl Glycol, Lecithin, Hydrolyzed Glycosaminoglycans, Sodium Hyaluronate, Caprylyl Glycol, Hydrogenated Lecithin, Caprylic/Capric Triglyceride, sh-Polypeptide-121, Sodium Palmitoyl Sarcosinate, Tocopherol, Sodium Hyaluronate Crosspolymer, Acetyl Glutamine, Caffeoyl Hexapeptide-65, Hydrolyzed Hyaluronic Acid, Heptasodium Hexacarboxymethyl Dipeptide-12, Bacillus/Folic Acid/Soybean Ferment Extract, Gold, Sodium Phosphate, Collagen, Hydroxypropyltrimonium Hyaluronate, Dextran, Benzoic Acid, Sodium Benzoate, Hydrolyzed Elastin, Myristoyl Pentapeptide-17, Myristoyl Pentapeptide-4, sh-Polypeptide-123, Palmitoyl Pentapeptide-5, Acetyl Tetrapeptide-3, Trifolium Pratense (Clover) Flower Extract, Copper Tripeptide-1, Palmitoyl Pentapeptide-4, Acetyl Hexapeptide-8, Hyaluronic Acid, Palmitoyl Tetrapeptide-7, sh-Decapeptide-7, sh-Octapeptide-4, sh-Oligopeptide-9, sh-Pentapeptide-19, Palmitoyl Tripeptide-1, Sodium Acetylated Hyaluronate, Tripeptide-32, sr-(Oligopeptide-91 Clostridium Botulinum Polypeptide-1), sh-Oligopeptide-1, sh-Polypeptide-1, sh-Oligopeptide-2, sh-Polypeptide-11, sh-Polypeptide-9, sh-Polypeptide-16, sh-Polypeptide-22, sh-Polypeptide-3, sh-Polypeptide-19, sh-Polypeptide-62</p>\n      <p><strong>Fórmula</strong></p>\n      <ul class=\"sor-b13__list\">\n        <li>Sin parabenos</li>\n        <li>Sin aceites minerales</li>\n        <li>Sin ftalatos</li>\n        <li>Sin ingredientes agresivos</li>\n        <li>Cruelty free</li>\n      </ul>\n    </div>\n  </details>\n\n  <details class=\"sor-b13__acc\">\n    <summary class=\"sor-b13__sum\">\n      <span class=\"sor-b13__titre\">¿Es apto para todo tipo de piel, incluso la sensible?</span>\n      <span class=\"sor-b13__chev\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>\n    </summary>\n    <div class=\"sor-b13__body\">\n      <p>Sí. La fórmula está pensada para un <strong>uso diario</strong> y también es apta para <strong>pieles sensibles</strong>.</p>\n      <p>La textura es ligera, no pega y no deja residuos, por lo que el tratamiento resulta cómodo incluso en las zonas más delicadas.</p>\n    </div>\n  </details>\n\n  <details class=\"sor-b13__acc\">\n    <summary class=\"sor-b13__sum\">\n      <span class=\"sor-b13__titre\">¿Tiene certificaciones?</span>\n      <span class=\"sor-b13__chev\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>\n    </summary>\n    <div class=\"sor-b13__body\">\n      <p>El producto se ha desarrollado respetando la <strong>normativa cosmética europea</strong>, una de las más estrictas del mundo, y es <strong>cruelty free</strong>.</p>\n      <p>La fórmula se elabora con <strong>altos estándares de calidad</strong> y controles de seguridad, y está pensada para un uso diario, incluso en piel sensible.</p>\n      <p>Por transparencia, no comunicamos certificaciones superfluas o engañosas: preferimos centrarnos en <strong>ingredientes seleccionados, la tolerancia y resultados visibles</strong>.</p>\n      <p>La lista completa de ingredientes (INCI) está siempre disponible en su apartado.</p>\n    </div>\n  </details>\n\n  <details class=\"sor-b13__acc\">\n    <summary class=\"sor-b13__sum\">\n      <span class=\"sor-b13__titre\">¿Puedo usarlo con mi rutina habitual?</span>\n      <span class=\"sor-b13__chev\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>\n    </summary>\n    <div class=\"sor-b13__body\">\n      <p>Por supuesto. El sérum se integra fácilmente en tu rutina: aplícalo sobre la piel limpia, <strong>antes de la crema</strong>, y deja que se absorba. También es perfecto <strong>antes del maquillaje</strong>, porque ayuda a que la piel se vea más lisa y uniforme.</p>\n    </div>\n  </details>\n\n  <details class=\"sor-b13__acc\">\n    <summary class=\"sor-b13__sum\">\n      <span class=\"sor-b13__titre\">¿Deja la piel pegajosa o brillante?</span>\n      <span class=\"sor-b13__chev\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>\n    </summary>\n    <div class=\"sor-b13__body\">\n      <p>No. La textura es <strong>ligera y sedosa</strong>, se absorbe rápido y deja la piel <strong>lisa y cómoda</strong>, sin efecto pegajoso ni brillos. Perfecta como base antes del maquillaje.</p>\n    </div>\n  </details>\n\n  <details class=\"sor-b13__acc\">\n    <summary class=\"sor-b13__sum\">\n      <span class=\"sor-b13__titre\">¿Es un relleno o un tratamiento invasivo?</span>\n      <span class=\"sor-b13__chev\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>\n    </summary>\n    <div class=\"sor-b13__body\">\n      <p>No. Es un <strong>tratamiento cosmético</strong>, no invasivo. El efecto lifting es <strong>visual y natural</strong>, gracias a la microrred cosmética de los péptidos de seda y a la acción progresiva de los activos, sin agujas, sin rellenos ni procedimientos agresivos. El aplicador <strong>no tiene aguja</strong>: solo sirve para dosificar.</p>\n    </div>\n  </details>\n\n  <details class=\"sor-b13__acc\">\n    <summary class=\"sor-b13__sum\">\n      <span class=\"sor-b13__titre\">¿Y si no quedo satisfecha?</span>\n      <span class=\"sor-b13__chev\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>\n    </summary>\n    <div class=\"sor-b13__body\">\n      <p>Puedes probarlo sin riesgo.</p>\n      <p>Si no estás satisfecha con los resultados, tienes nuestra <strong>garantía de devolución de {{ sor_garantie_jours }} días</strong>, con reembolso completo.</p>\n    </div>\n  </details>\n</section>\n\n<style>\n  .sor-b13{\n    padding-top:var(--sor-espace-sections, 44px) !important;\n    --sor-ink:#2B2220;\n    --sor-texte:#4A3F3C;\n    --sor-gris:#6F6461;\n    --sor-rose:#D9A79D;\n    --sor-rose-fonce:#9A5E53;\n    --sor-rose-clair:#F8ECE9;\n    --sor-ligne:#EFE3E0;\n    margin:14px 0 18px;\n    border-top:1px solid var(--sor-ligne);\n  }\n  .sor-b13__acc{ border-bottom:1px solid var(--sor-ligne); }\n\n  .sor-b13__sum{\n    list-style:none;\n    display:flex;\n    align-items:center;\n    gap:10px;\n    min-height:54px;\n    padding:10px 2px;\n    cursor:pointer;\n    -webkit-tap-highlight-color:transparent;\n  }\n  .sor-b13__sum::-webkit-details-marker{ display:none; }\n  .sor-b13__sum::marker{ content:\"\"; }\n  .sor-b13__sum:focus-visible{ outline:2px solid var(--sor-rose-fonce); outline-offset:2px; border-radius:6px; }\n\n  .sor-b13__titre{\n    flex:1;\n    font-family:var(--font-heading-family, inherit);\n    font-style:var(--font-heading-style, normal);\n    font-weight:var(--font-heading-weight, 700);\n    font-size:15px;\n    letter-spacing:0;\n    text-transform:none;\n    color:var(--sor-ink);\n    line-height:1.3;\n  }\n  .sor-b13__chev{\n    flex:0 0 18px;\n    width:18px; height:18px;\n    position:relative;\n  }\n  .sor-b13__chev::before,\n  .sor-b13__chev::after{\n    content:\"\";\n    position:absolute;\n    left:50%; top:50%;\n    width:12px; height:2px;\n    border-radius:2px;\n    background:var(--sor-rose-fonce);\n    transform:translate(-50%,-50%);\n    transition:transform .25s ease;\n  }\n  .sor-b13__chev::after{ transform:translate(-50%,-50%) rotate(90deg); }\n  .sor-b13__acc[open] .sor-b13__chev::after{ transform:translate(-50%,-50%) rotate(0deg); }\n\n  .sor-b13__body{\n    padding:0 2px 16px;\n    font-size:14.5px;\n    line-height:1.6;\n    color:var(--sor-texte);\n  }\n  .sor-b13__body p{ margin:0 0 10px; }\n  .sor-b13__body strong{ color:var(--sor-ink); }\n  .sor-b13__body a{ color:var(--sor-rose-fonce); text-underline-offset:2px; }\n\n  .sor-b13__list,\n  .sor-b13__ingr{\n    margin:0 0 10px;\n    padding:0;\n    list-style:none;\n  }\n  .sor-b13__list li,\n  .sor-b13__ingr li{\n    position:relative;\n    padding-left:18px;\n    margin-bottom:7px;\n  }\n  .sor-b13__list li::before,\n  .sor-b13__ingr li::before{\n    content:\"\";\n    position:absolute;\n    left:2px; top:.62em;\n    width:7px; height:7px;\n    border-radius:50%;\n    background:var(--sor-rose);\n  }\n\n  .sor-b13__dose{\n    display:grid;\n    grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;\n    gap:8px;\n    margin:4px 0 12px;\n  }\n  .sor-b13__dose-item{\n    display:flex;\n    flex-direction:column;\n    gap:2px;\n    padding:10px;\n    border-radius:12px;\n    background:var(--sor-rose-clair);\n  }\n  .sor-b13__dose-when{\n    font-size:11px;\n    font-weight:700;\n    letter-spacing:.08em;\n    text-transform:uppercase;\n    color:var(--sor-rose-fonce);\n  }\n  .sor-b13__dose-qty{\n    font-size:22px;\n    font-weight:800;\n    line-height:1.1;\n    color:var(--sor-ink);\n  }\n  .sor-b13__dose-why{\n    font-size:12.5px;\n    line-height:1.35;\n    color:var(--sor-gris);\n  }\n\n  .sor-b13__steps{\n    margin:0 0 10px;\n    padding-left:18px;\n  }\n  .sor-b13__steps li{ margin-bottom:6px; padding-left:2px; }\n  .sor-b13__steps li::marker{ color:var(--sor-rose-fonce); font-weight:700; }\n\n  .sor-b13__note{\n    padding:10px 12px;\n    border-left:3px solid var(--sor-rose);\n    border-radius:0 10px 10px 0;\n    background:#FCF7F6;\n    font-size:13.5px;\n  }\n\n  @media (min-width:750px){\n    .sor-b13__titre{ font-size:16px; }\n    .sor-b13__body{ font-size:15px; }\n  }\n  .sor-b13{ margin:18px 0; }\n  .sor-b13__h2{\n    margin:0 0 12px;\n    text-align:center;\n    font-family:var(--font-heading-family, inherit);\n    font-style:var(--font-heading-style, normal);\n    font-weight:var(--font-heading-weight, 700);\n    font-size:29px;\n    line-height:1.2;\n    color:var(--sor-ink);\n  }\n  .sor-b13__inci{ font-size:12.5px; line-height:1.55; color:var(--sor-gris); }\n  @media (min-width:750px){ .sor-b13__h2{ font-size:35px; } }\n</style>",
        "background": "",
        "background_gradient": "",
        "text_color": ""
      }
