        "liquid": "{%- comment -%}\n  SORELYA ES — BLOC 16 : contact + 4 réassurances (bas de page produit)\n  Clone de la bande de réassurance BioChroma (garantie, livraison, paiement, service client).\n  100 % code : icônes SVG inline, aucun visuel à produire. Mobile-first : grille 2×2, 4 colonnes dès 750 px.\n  Placement : dernière section Custom Liquid de la fiche, après la FAQ (bloc 13), padding haut/bas 0.\n  Volontairement absent : « testé dermatologiquement » tant qu'aucun test fournisseur n'est en main.\n  Livraison gratuite sur toutes les commandes et e-mail support validés le 2026-09-29.\n{%- endcomment -%}\n\n{%- assign sor_garantie_jours = \"99\" -%}\n{%- assign sor_email          = \"support@mysorelya.com\" -%}\n{%- assign sor_titre          = \"¿Tienes alguna duda? Estamos aquí para ayudarte\" -%}\n\n<section class=\"sor-b16\">\n  <p class=\"sor-b16__contact\">{{ sor_titre }}<br><a href=\"mailto:{{ sor_email }}\">{{ sor_email }}</a></p>\n  <ul class=\"sor-b16__grid\" role=\"list\">\n    <li class=\"sor-b16__item\">\n      <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 3l7 3v5.5c0 4.3-3 7.7-7 9.5-4-1.8-7-5.2-7-9.5V6z\"/><path d=\"M8.8 12.2l2.2 2.2 4.3-4.4\"/></svg>\n      <strong>Garantía {{ sor_garantie_jours }} días</strong>\n      <span>Satisfecha o te devolvemos tu dinero</span>\n    </li>\n    <li class=\"sor-b16__item\">\n      <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M2.5 6.5h11v9h-11z\"/><path d=\"M13.5 9.5h4l3 3v3h-7\"/><circle cx=\"7\" cy=\"17.5\" r=\"1.6\"/><circle cx=\"17\" cy=\"17.5\" r=\"1.6\"/></svg>\n      <strong>Envío gratis</strong>\n      <span>En todos los pedidos</span>\n    </li>\n    <li class=\"sor-b16__item\">\n      <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"4.5\" y=\"10.5\" width=\"15\" height=\"10\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M8 10.5V7.5a4 4 0 0 1 8 0v3\"/></svg>\n      <strong>Pago 100 % seguro</strong>\n      <span>Tarjeta, PayPal y Apple Pay</span>\n    </li>\n    <li class=\"sor-b16__item\">\n      <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4.5 13v-1.5a7.5 7.5 0 0 1 15 0V13\"/><rect x=\"3.5\" y=\"12.5\" width=\"4\" height=\"6\" rx=\"1.5\"/><rect x=\"16.5\" y=\"12.5\" width=\"4\" height=\"6\" rx=\"1.5\"/><path d=\"M18.5 18.5c0 1.4-1.6 2.5-4 2.5\"/></svg>\n      <strong>Atención al cliente</strong>\n      <span>Te respondemos en 24 h</span>\n    </li>\n  </ul>\n</section>\n\n<style>\n  .sor-b16{\n    padding-top:var(--sor-espace-sections, 44px) !important;\n    --sor-ink:#2B2220;\n    --sor-texte:#4A3F3C;\n    --sor-rose-fonce:#9A5E53;\n    --sor-rose-clair:#F8ECE9;\n    margin:18px 0 8px;\n  }\n  .sor-b16__contact{\n    margin:0 0 14px;\n    text-align:center;\n    font-size:15px;\n    line-height:1.5;\n    color:var(--sor-texte);\n  }\n  .sor-b16__contact a{ color:var(--sor-rose-fonce); font-weight:700; text-underline-offset:2px; }\n  .sor-b16__grid{\n    list-style:none;\n    margin:0;\n    padding:0;\n    display:grid;\n    grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;\n    gap:8px;\n  }\n  .sor-b16__item{\n    display:flex;\n    flex-direction:column;\n    align-items:center;\n    text-align:center;\n    gap:4px;\n    padding:14px 8px;\n    border-radius:14px;\n    background:var(--sor-rose-clair);\n  }\n  .sor-b16__item svg{\n    width:30px; height:30px;\n    margin-bottom:2px;\n    fill:none;\n    stroke:var(--sor-rose-fonce);\n    stroke-width:1.6;\n    stroke-linecap:round;\n    stroke-linejoin:round;\n  }\n  .sor-b16__item strong{\n    font-family:var(--font-heading-family, inherit);\n    font-weight:var(--font-heading-weight, 700);\n    font-size:14.5px;\n    line-height:1.25;\n    color:var(--sor-ink);\n  }\n  .sor-b16__item span{\n    font-size:12.5px;\n    line-height:1.35;\n    color:var(--sor-texte);\n  }\n  @media (min-width:750px){\n    .sor-b16__grid{ grid-template-columns:repeat(4, 1fr); gap:12px; }\n    .sor-b16__item strong{ font-size:15.5px; }\n  }\n</style>",
